WEBVTT

00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:30.463
we watch and wait

00:01:30.497 --> 00:01:34.397
and remain grateful we're able
to make things with our hands.

00:01:46.897 --> 00:01:50.130
A love letter to New York City
by Debbie Millman

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:52.997
I'm a native New Yorker.

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:56.297
I've lived here my entire life,

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:59.230
yet the city never ceases to surprise me.

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.297
Everywhere you look,
there's something to see.